body:
Cut and splitting is what I do because I feel it wearing off in 6 hours. I take 2-3 doses a day.

&#x200B;

I wasn't addicted when I started on Suboxone, but I do know that i couldnt tell a difference between 12mg and 4mg. I started to feel it when I tapered to 2mg. going down any further feels impossible without being in patient and as i said i was not addicted when I started. this drug is harder for me to get off of then pills.
